1
00:00:00,539 --> 00:00:04,329
(Howard:)...wearing the birthday king crown,
playing laser tag with all my friends.

2
00:00:04,501 --> 00:00:06,541
Yeah, see? That's what kids should have.

3
00:00:06,711 --> 00:00:09,091
(Howard:)Actually, that was last year.

4
00:00:12,008 --> 00:00:15,388
(Penny:)So you've really never had
a birthday party?

5
00:00:15,554 --> 00:00:17,054
(Leonard:)No, but it was okay.

6
00:00:17,222 --> 00:00:21,472
When I was little, I'd think my parents
would change their mind and surprise me.

7
00:00:21,643 --> 00:00:24,143
(Leonard:)This one birthday,
I came home from my cello lesson...

8
00:00:24,312 --> 00:00:26,272
...and I saw strange cars
parked out front.

9
00:00:26,439 --> 00:00:28,439
(Leonard:)When I got to the door,
I hear whispering...

10
00:00:28,608 --> 00:00:32,028
(Leonard:)...and I could smell German chocolate cake,
which is my favorite.

11
00:00:32,946 --> 00:00:36,736
- And?
- It turns out my grandfather had died.

12
00:00:37,409 --> 00:00:39,659
(Penny:)Oh, my God, that's terrible.

13
00:00:39,828 --> 00:00:42,038
Well, it was kind of like a birthday party.

14
00:00:42,789 --> 00:00:46,379
(Leonard:)I got to see all my cousins,
and there was cake, so...

15
00:00:47,169 --> 00:00:50,209
- That's the saddest thing I've ever heard.
- You think?

16
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:54,020
(Howard:)Go ahead,
tell her about your senior prom.

